X-Wing vs TIE Fighter recomp

A fork of the X-Wing recomp (https://github.com/sp00nznet/xwing-recomp): the
same engine, host and remaster. That host derives from the Crazy Taxi recomp,
softdd.c from the Beavis and Butt-head in Virtual Stupidity recomp; all run on
pcrecomp's native32 runtime (https://github.com/sp00nznet/pcrecomp), all MIT.

Star Wars: X-Wing vs TIE Fighter is (c) Lucasfilm Ltd. No part of the game is included.
